@startuml
title System components — draft
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "App user" as User

package "Mobile decision-support system" {
  component "Mobile application" as Mobile
  component "API boundary" as API
  component "Authentication" as Auth
  component "Diagnosis orchestration" as Diagnosis
  component "Inference interface" as Inference
  component "Mock inference / future model" as Model
  database "Persistence for user and history records" as Store
}

User --> Mobile : photo, login, history
Mobile --> API : application requests
API --> Auth : register / authenticate
API --> Diagnosis : analysis / history requests
Diagnosis --> Inference : preliminary classification request
Inference --> Model : model input
Model --> Inference : class probabilities
Diagnosis --> Store : user and history records
API --> Mobile : class, probabilities,
specialist recommendation, disclaimer
Mobile --> User : result and history

note bottom of Inference
  Inference deployment is undecided.
  The mock/future adapter is a draft boundary.
end note

note bottom of Store
  Database technology, image storage,
  and retention are undecided.
end note
@enduml
